{"version":1,"key":"card:681","content":{"id":681,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密码学是什么？密码学是保护协议免受攻击的科学。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是协议？协议是为了完成某一件事情必须遵守的一系列步骤。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密码学算法通常也被称为密码学原语，可以将密码学原语看作是密码学中一种最小算法的构造，常和其它原语一起一起构造新协议。"}]}],"tags":["密码学"],"createTime":1770254040201,"updateTime":1771079291157,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1771079291157}}